Routing Factors
The planner makes routing decisions on two dimensions simultaneously:
Content flags — what the request is about:
Ethical questions → escalate toward judicial review (14BR)
Constitutional decisions → escalate toward judicial review (14BR)
Philosophical depth → escalate toward deep reasoning (8BR, 14BR)
Knowledge graph queries → activate kg_query step
Code requests → activate code path nodes
Complexity flags — how difficult the request is:
Multi-step dependency chains → escalate reasoning depth
Cross-domain reasoning → escalate reasoning depth
Ambiguous intent → escalate, or trigger clarification
Simple greeting or surface query → stay at fast route
Either content flag or complexity flag can trigger escalation independently. Both together guarantee the deep route.
